<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>The earnings are steady—not extreme.</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">That’s how you know it’s real.</p>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Why Local Platforms Are Safer</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Here’s something many people overlook.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Global platforms:</p>



