<li>Promising unrealistic income</li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">SurveyPesa focuses on:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Simple survey tasks</li>



<li>Realistic earnings</li>



<li><strong>M-Pesa withdrawals</strong></li>
