<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Let’s keep this simple and actionable.</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Never pay to join a survey platform</strong></li>



<li><strong>Ignore “guaranteed income” promises</strong></li>



<li><strong>Avoid Telegram/WhatsApp job offers</strong></li>



<li><strong>Research before signing up</strong></li>



<li><strong>Start with one trusted platform</strong></li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">If something feels off, it usually is.</p>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading">The Mindset That Protects You</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Here’s the biggest lesson.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">If you approach surveys thinking:<br>“I’ll get rich quickly”</p>



